# U.S.S. Enterprise-E, Sovereign ({3}{W}{W}): Station puts charge counters equal to the stationing creature's power on it, and
# "8+ | Flying, vigilance" makes it a 7/7 artifact creature with flying and vigilance. A Quakestrider Ceratops (12 power)
# stations it. The enters trigger offers no target because nothing is tapped when it resolves, so the Ceratops survives to
# station it and the Spacecraft is untapped when it becomes a creature.

